  "description": "If there's Hogwarts, a wizarding school in England, then there's Muwigwan in South Korea.\n\nThe story of Jeong Tae-mi, an ordinary high school girl who was forced to enroll in a martial arts school, and her greedy life as a college entrance exam taker who can't give up her training to become a Taoist priest, begins with her turbulent growth.\n\nI don't have a grand mission to protect the Earth, nor do I want to learn Taoism and become a Taoist.\n\nIt would be good to experience a little more—the world that Muwigwan will show you and the connections you'll make here.\n\nKeep going for now!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63095659), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%8F%84%EC%82%AC-%EC%95%84%EC%B9%B4%EB%8D%B0%EB%AF%B8-%EB%AC%B4%EC%9C%84%EA%B4%80/3850)",
